<title>UK: Courtaulds drops as Kleinwort downgrades.</title>
<headline>Courtaulds drops as Kleinwort downgrades.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Courtaulds Plc fell in early trading on Monday as analysts at Kleinwort Benson cut its rating on the stock to &quot;sell&quot; from &quot;hold&quot; and lowered profit estimates for the chemical company, market sources said.</p>
<p>Courtaulds shares were down 7-1/2p at 480 by 0804 GMT, after yesterday closing at their highest level since September 1994.</p>
<p>Analysts at the brokerage were not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
</text>
